Shabbir ki mazloom behen quld se aao fariyad ko pohuncho,<br>
Shahzadi kanizo ki muradou ko dilao fariyad ko pohuncho.<br>
<br>
Aaye hai jo is dar pe to qali na phirenge hum leke uthenge,<br>
Bibi dare aqdas se na mehrum phirao fariyad ko pohuncho.<br>
<br>
Faqa kashi o gurbat o iflaas se Bibi tang aaye hai hum sab,<br>
Ab tumko qasam Hazrate Abbas ki aao fariyad ko pohuncho.<br>
<br>
Bibi tumhe is Shere dilawar ki qasam hai Akber ki qasam hai,<br>
Shabbir ke sadqe me musibat se chudhao fariyad ko pohuncho.<br>
<br>
Bimariye Sajjad ki deti hu qasam ab aye Hazrate Zainab,<br>
Bimaar jo hai unko shifa jald dilao fariyad ko pohuncho.<br>
<br>
Bibi tumhe ab Auno Mohammed ki qasam hai Qasim ki qasam hai,<br>
Ab apne kanizou ki madad karne ko aao fariyad ko pohuncho.<br>
<br>
Jo daulate aulad se mehrum hai Bibi az behre Payamber,<br>
Imdaad unhe aap ke hi dar se ata ho fariyad ko pohuncho.<br>
<br>
Shazadiye Kounain 'Himayat' hai pareshan woh saqt hai hairaa'n,<br>
Lillah bas ab iski madad karne ko aao fariyad ko pohuncho.